Common Issues
Issue: Initialization Fails
**Symptoms**: CP_TR_SWCModelingGuide_Init() returns E_NOT_OK
**Possible Causes**: - NULL configuration pointer - Invalid configuration parameters - Insufficient memory
**Solutions**: - Verify configuration is valid - Check memory allocation - Review error log from DET
Issue: MainFunction Not Called
**Symptoms**: Module state unchanged over time
